---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Find a place that fits your life">
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">For buyers</p>
      <h1>
        A clearer path
        <br />
        to your next home.
      </h1>
      <p>
        From your first questions to the final walkthrough, understand your
        options before you decide.
      </p>
      <h2>01 / Make a plan</h2>
      <p>
        Discuss your goals, timing, financing conversations, and the features
        that matter to you.
      </p>
      <h2>02 / Explore and compare</h2>
      <p>
        Evaluate properties against your priorities, ask useful questions, and
        understand the tradeoffs.
      </p>
      <h2>03 / Offer to closing</h2>
      <p>
        Get guidance through the offer, due diligence, and closing process.
        Local practices, timelines, and contract terms vary.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="button" href="/contact/">
          Let’s start with a conversation ↗
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
